1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:07,250
The Four Sect Alliance opens its gates !

25
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:12,770
We recruit all kinds of cultivators, rogue, demonic, orthodox.

26
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:14,810
Join us to prepare for war.

27
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,810
If you don't come,

28
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:19,050
you will suffer the consequences !

29
00:02:24,830 --> 00:02:27,090
A heavy snow has been falling

30
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,450
day and night.

31
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:30,570
In a single month,

32
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:33,890
the mortal world has begun to collapse.

33
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,770
The cultivators of the Four Sect Alliance

34
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:40,970
have tried to stop the snow from falling.

35
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:44,250
They have also tried to use spells to clear the snow

36
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:46,130
but they all failed.

37
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,610
In the end,

38
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:49,930
The cultivators ordered the mortal emperor

39
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:55,450
to summon a large number of mortals to clear the snow themselves.

40
00:02:55,430 --> 00:02:56,890
We need to go clear the snow.

41
00:02:56,810 --> 00:02:59,250
Those who disobey will be killed...

42
00:02:57,770 --> 00:02:59,460
You can't bring these things with you.

43
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:04,130
Take this with you and keep it close to your body.

44
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,210
Okay.

45
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,330
Uncle Wang,

46
00:03:06,340 --> 00:03:07,890
it's cold outside.

47
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,330
Remember to keep some firewood at home.

48
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,330
Go back inside !

49
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,050
Keep up !

50
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,690
Let's go.

51
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,210
Quick !

52
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,730
Keep up.

53
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,690
What's this nonsense ?

54
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:18,250
Hurry up !

55
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:36,810
We haven't met in more than 10 years.

56
00:03:36,650 --> 00:03:39,090
Fellow cultivator Zhou still looks the same.

57
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:41,690
Brother Wang,

58
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,850
you have indeed gone farther than I have.

59
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,490
It seems that I

60
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:48,210
have been marching in place, without progressing my domain.

61
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,860
You already finished carving Master Qing Song's

62
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,410
Passing of Time Domain.

63
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:56,810
This wood carving in Brother's hands

64
00:03:57,080 --> 00:04:01,410
is a top quality artifact for Nascent Soul cultivators.

65
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:04,170
You have improved so much

66
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:06,010
in a mere 10 years.

67
00:04:06,220 --> 00:04:07,730
I admire you.

68
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,890
If you like it,

69
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:15,050
I can give it to you.

70
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,160
Brother Wang,

71
00:04:20,960 --> 00:04:22,010
thank you.

72
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,090
With this wood carving,

73
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:27,730
I may use the Passing of Time Domain to reach Soul Formation.

74
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,050
But...

75
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:34,450
I admit defeat, don't give me another obsession.

76
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:37,170
I don't want this wood carving anymore.

77
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,570
You can have this jade,

78
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:43,210
it contains a Soul Formation spell.

79
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:47,170
If that's the case, I won't tempt you anymore.

80
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,810
With the shortcut in front of him,

81
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,810
he chose to keep his Dao Heart

82
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,250
and pursue his own domain.

83
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,890
He isn't the kind

84
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:59,690
that gives up easily.

85
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:00,570
Brother Wang,

86
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,970
have you noticed

87
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:04,650
anything strange about this snow ?

88
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,330
This snow

89
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:09,250
is not natural.

90
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,130
Correct.

91
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:12,450
There is killing intent inside the snow.

92
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:15,050
It's the magic of Xue Yue cultivators.

93
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:16,650
Xue Yue cultivators ?

94
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:20,730
Xue Yue is a rank 4 cultivation country in the North of Suzaku.

95
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:23,530
The cultivation methods of Xue Yue

96
00:05:23,340 --> 00:05:25,330
involve this magical snow.

97
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:28,850
When the Xue Yue attacks a country,

98
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:32,490
they use a one way formation to cover the country in snow.

99
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:36,010
The day the Four Sect Alliance is completely covered in snow,

100
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:39,050
will be the day Xue Yue attacks.

101
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:42,350
Brother Wang, please look.

102
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,050
I'm not kidding,

103
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,170
this snow

104
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,850
will not melt.

105
00:05:47,180 --> 00:05:48,720
I am here today

106
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,810
on behalf of the Four Sect Alliance

107
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:54,130
to invite Brother Wang to join us in this war.

108
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,130
Your cultivation,

109
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:58,890
is just a breath away from a breakthrough.

110
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,690
Once you join us,

111
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:02,970
the Four Sect Alliance's strength will increase greatly.

112
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,770
Brother Zhou,

113
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,730
I won't see you off.

114
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:12,690
The Four Sect Alliance is a thousand years old rank 4 country.

115
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,450
If you are willing to join,

116
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:17,810
I will grant any request that is within my power.

117
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,810
Will you at least consider it ?

118
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:22,730
Brother Wang, what's the meaning of this ?

119
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,650
Xue Yue comes from the other side of the planet.

120
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:28,930
Why are they invading here and not somewhere else ?

121
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:32,010
Since Brother Zhou doesn't want to tell me,

122
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:35,770
then I will not ask about it.

123
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:38,250
If you are willing to join the war,

124
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,850
I will tell you the truth.

125
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:44,050
Please.

126
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,490
Brother Zhou,

127
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:59,330
since this person is not willing to join the Four Sect Alliance,

128
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:02,860
You Kong
Black Soul Sect Elder
Late stage Nascent Soul

129
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:02,250
the order is to execute him with no mercy.

130
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,650
Why didn't you do it !?

131
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:11,600
This person has carvings of my White Cloud Sect Elders.

132
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:13,370
If you want to go, then go.

133
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,250
But I'm not looking for death.

134
00:07:15,350 --> 00:07:18,490
You Huan
Black Soul Sect Elder
Late stage Nascent Soul

135
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,250
So you really are afraid of him !

136
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:21,610
The three of us are the same cultivation level as him.

137
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,800
You Mie
Black Soul Sect Elder
Late stage Nascent Soul

138
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:23,930
If we use a formation,

139
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,930
he will die for sure.

140
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,650
Ink Bone Sword Formation,

141
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:45,850
activate !

142
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:05,850
It has been more than 30 years...

143
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,490
He destroyed our formation !?

144
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:45,650
Who...

145
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,450
Who the hell are you !?

146
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:53,090
You shouldn't have provoked me.

147
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,690
Brother Zhou,

148
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,610
come and help me !

149
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,050
Brother Zhou,

150
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:18,770
what are you doing !?

151
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:21,070
You angered Brother Wang,

152
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:23,290
how could I let you leave ?

153
00:09:34,770 --> 00:09:36,450
Brother Wang, don't worry.

154
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:39,930
These three died at the hands of Xue Yue.

155
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:47,650
This person should forever stay a friend,

156
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,930
not an enemy.

157
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:58,770
Middle of the night and some brats woke me up by fighting outside !

158
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:01,130
I had finally found a good spot to sleep in...

159
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,890
I’m really unlucky.

160
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,410
Warm up your body.

161
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,850
You are a good kid.

162
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:10,930
But...

163
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:13,250
I won't share my roasted chicken !

164
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,210
I needed wine with it.

165
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,250
Not bad, kid.

166
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:21,410
Soul Formation is not far away.

167
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:26,090
The Four Sect Alliance is chaotic right now.

168
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:28,530
Hurry up and reach Soul Formation !

169
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,650
Otherwise, with your cultivation,

170
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:34,090
you won't get anything good out of it.

171
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:37,250
Does Senior know what is happening with the Four Sect Alliance ?

172
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,450
A Four Sect Alliance cultivator

173
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:43,210
stole a Rain Cauldron that belonged to Xue Yue.

174
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:45,450
So they are here to take it back.

175
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:46,850
It's a small matter.

176
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,410
Rain Cauldron ?

177
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:50,290
Tell your King

178
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:52,330
to send the Rain Cauldron to my temple in 3 days

179
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:54,290
And I won't pursue this matter.

180
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:58,450
Speaking of this Rain Cauldron, to be honest,

181
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,970
there is more than one.

182
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:03,410
But it is useless on its own.

183
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:05,970
However, the day the Celestial Gates open,

184
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:09,620
the Rain Cauldron will grant you access to the Celestial Realm

185
00:11:09,390 --> 00:11:12,770
by using one of the 4 gates: Wind, Rain, Thunder, Lightning.

186
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:15,410
To enter the Celestial Realm ?

187
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:18,450
No wonder they fight over it.

188
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,430
What ?

189
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,650
Are you interested now ?

190
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,610
Sadly,

191
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:25,650
all the Ancient Celestials are gone.

192
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:28,810
They all died in battle.

193
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:31,850
The current Celestial Realm

194
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,890
is empty.

195
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:35,570
They all died ?

196
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,890
Of course they're all dead !

197
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:38,570
Otherwise, why do you think

198
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:41,410
Soul Transformation and above cultivators

199
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:43,250
are still around in this world ?

200
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,290
It's because...

201
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:46,770
they have nowhere else to go !

202
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:51,290
The Ancient Gods are all dead,

203
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:53,210
the Ancient Celestials are all dead.

204
00:11:53,020 --> 00:11:55,850
There aren't many ancient cultivators left

205
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:58,730
which is why the Cultivation Alliance appeared.

206
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:00,410
If that's the truth,

207
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:03,770
why are they fighting over the Rain Cauldron to enter it ?

208
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:06,650
The Celestial Realm is shattered in 4 pieces.

209
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:09,810
The 4 gates just lead to different sections of the Celestial Realm.

210
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:11,970
Although the Celestial Realm is shattered,

211
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:14,570
there are still many ancient artifacts in it.

212
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:16,530
It's pretty good stuff !

213
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,290
But the most important

214
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:21,210
is the celestial spiritual energy !

215
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:23,170
To reach Soul Transformation

216
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,690
without a Soul Transformation Pill

217
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:28,770
you need to absorb celestial spiritual energy to breakthrough.

218
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:33,010
Senior is very knowledgeable about the world,

219
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:34,210
you are so smart.

220
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,770
Junior admires you.

221
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,770
I admire you.

222
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:41,450
I came today to request a wood carving of myself.

223
00:12:41,270 --> 00:12:44,250
I'll give it to Xiao Cui from the Pink Pavillon !

224
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:46,890
That way she will always remember me...

225
00:12:47,880 --> 00:12:49,770
After I promised Senior,

226
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:52,690
I've tried to carve you many times.

227
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,330
This is it !

228
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:58,810
Yes yes yes !

229
00:12:58,560 --> 00:12:59,890
It looks like me !

230
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:01,010
It's the real me !

231
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:02,370
Your wood carving

232
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:06,010
has yet to match my handsomeness

233
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:08,130
but you're getting close to it.

234
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:10,010
It's completely negligible.

235
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,730
As long as Senior is satisfied.

236
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:16,210
You carved me well.

237
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:18,290
I will let you borrow

238
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:20,770
that straw hat for a while longer.

239
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:23,640
There are still 99 wood carvings left.

240
00:13:23,520 --> 00:13:26,130
Don't forget them when you reach Soul Formation !

241
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:27,970
Otherwise,

242
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,970
no matter where you go,

243
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:32,090
this old man will find you.

244
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,690
I will not forget

245
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,530
the promise I made to Senior.

246
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:40,730
In this war between Xue Yue and the Four Sect Alliance,

247
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,250
the Rain Cauldron is just a pretext.

248
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:46,000
The real reason is the annexation of this country.

249
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:50,530
There is an even higher-level cultivation country involved.

250
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,130
Kid,

251
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:55,650
you have to be careful.

252
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,090
The lights of thousands of families

253
00:14:10,890 --> 00:14:12,450
withered in an instant.

254
00:14:13,420 --> 00:14:15,810
Everything in the world is meant to die.

255
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:17,330
In my life,

256
00:14:17,980 --> 00:14:18,970
death

257
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:21,730
has been the shadow following me.

258
00:14:21,260 --> 00:14:28,050
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

259
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:24,050
The first person I killed

260
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,650
was Sun Dazhu.

261
00:14:26,280 --> 00:14:27,940
He took me as his disciple,

262
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,590
poisoned me

263
00:14:27,890 --> 00:14:34,160
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

264
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:31,370
and almost killed me.

265
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,840
Then I killed Bai Zhan,

266
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:36,930
he deserved it.

267
00:14:34,090 --> 00:14:38,170
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

268
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:39,410
Teng Li's arrogance

269
00:14:37,950 --> 00:14:42,100
and like many other unseparable things.

270
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:42,880
led me to a 400 years long killing spree.

271
00:14:42,210 --> 00:14:48,110
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

272
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:55,120
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

273
00:14:55,180 --> 00:15:00,970
Use the most vivid love and hate
