306
00:16:04,410 --> 00:16:10,220
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

307
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:11,050
These 30 years of turning mortal

308
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:17,090
Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers
while prosperity sprouts in summer.

309
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,610
have taught me the meaning of Life.

310
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,170
I am Death

311
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:19,720
and I am also Life.

312
00:16:17,140 --> 00:16:23,890
I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,
the law of cause and effect.

313
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:23,850
Rather than cultivating for thousands of years,

314
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:27,290
it was living the life of a mortal that made me realize

315
00:16:24,660 --> 00:16:30,610
I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.

316
00:16:30,530 --> 00:16:37,480
Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.
Reincarnation is not to be feared.

317
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:34,290
who I really am.

318
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,730
Uncle Niu,

319
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:50,730
