320
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:55,410
I don't know how my wife is doing.

321
00:16:56,160 --> 00:16:57,490
And also Uncle Wang...

322
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:01,290
I wanted Uncle Wang to get a little bit older

323
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:04,450
