324
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:06,810
and serve him for his last years.

325
00:17:07,840 --> 00:17:10,930
This snow has been going on for too long.

326
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:13,660
There is no ending to this.

327
00:17:12,670 --> 00:17:14,850
We must look ahead !

328
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:21,090
Uncle Niu, let's move to another country.

329
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,690
