339
00:18:02,540 --> 00:18:03,290
Hurry up !

340
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:22,140
Uncle Wang !

341
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,530
My dear wife !

342
00:18:24,360 --> 00:18:25,490
Xiao Niu !

343
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:27,490
Don't be afraid,

344
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:29,250
I'm here to save you !

345
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:31,330
I will take you to another country !

346
00:18:57,050 --> 00:18:58,410
There is no way out.

347
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:02,450
There is no way out...

348
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:06,700
My wife...

349
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:08,650
Xiao Niu...

350
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:12,370
Uncle Wang...

351
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:14,330
Da Niu,

352
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:15,930
it's okay.

353
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:18,210
Uncle Wang is here.

354
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,730
Uncle Wang...?

355
00:19:30,170 --> 00:19:30,930
You...

356
00:19:31,740 --> 00:19:32,770
really are

357
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:34,410
an Immortal ?

358
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:36,530
There's no need to be afraid.

359
00:19:37,880 --> 00:19:38,930
Let's go.

360
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:40,970
I'll take you

361
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:43,250
to find your family.

362
00:19:52,280 --> 00:19:53,580
Where am I ?

363
00:19:53,340 --> 00:19:54,410
My dear husband ?

364
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:56,570
Dad, Mom !

365
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,210
Xiao Niu ?

366
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:00,090
Have a look !

367
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:03,210
We're outside !

368
00:20:03,520 --> 00:20:04,610
We're really...

369
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:06,210
in another country !

370
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:09,570
Why are we here ?

371
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,850
I remember I was still inside the house

372
00:20:11,610 --> 00:20:13,490
when I fell asleep.

373
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:27,130
It was Uncle Wang that saved us.

374
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:27,930
Uncle Wang ?

375
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:37,290
Uncle Wang,

376
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:38,770
thank you.

377
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:40,770
Take care of yourself.

378
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:50,530
The time of Soul Formation has come.

379
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:53,250
I only need to go in seclusion for 10 years.

380
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:57,050
But the opportunity to get a Rain Cauldron is rare.

381
00:20:57,660 --> 00:21:00,860
Now that the war is about to begin, I will use this opportunity

382
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:02,450
to steal the Rain Cauldron.

383
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:05,810
It's my best chance to enter the Celestial Realm.

384
00:21:12,560 --> 00:23:58,970
Wang Lin's new look represents Life and Death merged together. The white robes represent Life and his hairpin represents Death.

Gradually, more and more carvings flew to him, but at this moment, a black vortex appeared between his hands. Even though the wood carvings went in one by one, the size of the black vortex didn’t change at all. One by one, the wood carvings flew into the black vortex.

The black vortex quickly changed shapes under Wang Lin’s control. Finally, it turned into a square and gradually became solid. Slowly, the black vortex disappeared and a black stamp appeared before Wang Lin.

The stamp was the size of Wang Lin’s palm and had the carving of a person on it, but this person didn’t have a face or features, only a figure. This black stamp contained Wang Lin’s 400 years of killing. It was the physical form of Death.

Wang Lin’s right hand pressed down on top of the black stamp. A sense of being submerged in blood suddenly appeared in his heart. Then he took a deep breath and the stamp gradually entered his Nascent Soul.

-> Wang Lin wears the same hairpin as the Death wood carving.

Wang Lin slowly walked on the street as the snowstorm got even worse.
His figure when he walked out from the shop was still that of an old man at the end of his days, but as he walked toward the end of the street, his back gradually straightened. The wrinkles on his face slowly disappeared, and by the time he arrived at the end of the street, he had successfully changed from a mortal to a cultivator.

385
00:21:20,490 --> 00:21:24,620
I've had my share of wounds,

386
00:21:22,530 --> 00:21:24,620
now I want to fight back.

387
00:21:24,450 --> 00:21:28,180
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

388
00:21:28,010 --> 00:21:34,100
that's blocking all my hopes

389
00:21:30,890 --> 00:21:34,100
for life ?

390
00:21:35,650 --> 00:21:39,860
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

391
00:21:37,370 --> 00:21:39,860
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

392
00:21:39,930 --> 00:21:43,260
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

393
00:21:43,370 --> 00:21:49,260
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

394
00:21:46,090 --> 00:21:49,260
out of reach.

395
00:21:50,370 --> 00:21:54,740
Immortals

396
00:21:51,410 --> 00:21:54,740
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

397
00:21:54,770 --> 00:21:58,780
Renegades

398
00:21:55,530 --> 00:21:58,780
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

399
00:21:58,530 --> 00:22:02,620
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

400
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:02,620
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

401
00:22:02,610 --> 00:22:06,740
because I don't see the harm in that.

402
00:22:08,490 --> 00:22:14,540
My new body opens its eyes

403
00:22:11,010 --> 00:22:14,540
and awakens from its dream.

404
00:22:14,410 --> 00:22:22,100
I have overcome many trials

405
00:22:16,530 --> 00:22:22,100
to get this body back.

406
00:22:22,050 --> 00:22:29,740
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

407
00:22:26,090 --> 00:22:29,740
I can still see.

408
00:22:29,890 --> 00:22:39,100
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

409
00:22:33,850 --> 00:22:39,100
by my own hands.

410
00:23:09,730 --> 00:23:15,940
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

411
00:23:12,450 --> 00:23:15,940
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

412
00:23:15,690 --> 00:23:23,500
With a flick of a finger,

413
00:23:17,130 --> 00:23:23,500
only my indomitable heart remains.

414
00:23:23,290 --> 00:23:32,900
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

415
00:23:29,250 --> 00:23:32,900
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

416
00:23:32,890 --> 00:23:40,740
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

417
00:23:35,410 --> 00:23:40,740
like the descent of a god.
